      "value": "It works. You need to call CombatSetup on remote players.\n\nTest world: https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_efcb1d76-64ba-4408-8a57-31e6ed64b3f9\n\nI heard this from IwacchiK. thanks! https://x.com/IwacchiK/status/1926907467801186313\n\nSo, no documentation is the problem. https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/players/",
