  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The ragdolls created by the combat system do not work in Udon worlds for remote clients. Locally the ragdoll still works, but for other players you will look like you are standing still when you die.\nRepo worlds:\nUdon world using combat system (use a tall avatar and crouch through the tunnel, then stand up on the other end):\nwrld_8e929d87-ecc0-4c7f-b513-a81758a408a9\nSDK2 world using combat system (join different teams and shoot each other):\nwrld_d466194c-ef53-4812-9a2c-bdb4c5e2b037",
